## MDR_005: NAR Architecture

### Requirements Per Document:
1. **Serverless Agent Model** - Idle = 0 Agents, Spawn on Intent ✅
2. **Context Constructor (Factory)** - spawn_context(intent) ✅
3. **Librarian as Cron Job** - Scheduled instance, not permanent ⚠️

### Gap Analysis:
| Requirement | Implemented? | Notes |
|:------------|:-------------|:------|
| Factory Pattern | ✅ | `ContextFactory.create_context()` |
| Ephemeral Agents | ✅ | `EphemeralAgent.run()` terminates |
| Librarian Cron | ⚠️ | Cron exists, but calls old script. Should verify it calls Agent Runtime. |

**Missing:** Verify crontab entry actually invokes [nightly_agent.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/nightly_agent.py) (the refactored one).

