## MDR_010: Adoption

### Requirements Per Document:
1. **"Did I Help?" Feedback Loop** - Telegram asks Y/N ⚠️
2. **Usage Telemetry** - `days_since_last_interaction`, manual_overrides_count ⚠️
3. **Kill Switch Protocol** - Escalate if no engagement for 14 days ⚠️
4. **Synergy Metric** - `Value Ratio = High Impact Closures / Total Notifications` ✅

### Gap Analysis:
| Requirement | Implemented? | Notes |
|:------------|:-------------|:------|
| Feedback Loop | ⚠️ | Functions exist ([record_feedback](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/commitment_ledger.py#599-626)), but Telegram bot doesn't ACTUALLY use buttons |
| Usage Telemetry | ⚠️ | [record_interaction](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/commitment_ledger.py#491-496) exists, but not verified as called in all entry points |
| Kill Switch | ⚠️ | [check_kill_switch](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/commitment_ledger.py#546-569) exists, but not wired into bot |
| Value Ratio | ✅ | `get_value_ratio()` implemented |

**Missing:**
1. Telegram bot needs **actual inline buttons** for feedback (not just text)
2. [check_kill_switch](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/commitment_ledger.py#546-569) needs to be called on bot startup
3. Verify [record_interaction](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/commitment_ledger.py#491-496) is called in all entry points

