2. **MDR_005:** Verify crontab points to refactored [nightly_agent.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/nightly_agent.py)
3. **MDR_010:** Implement real Telegram inline buttons for feedback collection
4. **MDR_008:** Create `nucleus-nar` package for standalone OSS release
